<title>USA: NYCE certificated cotton stocks drop to 181,230.</title>
<headline>NYCE certificated cotton stocks drop to 181,230.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of June 13 totaled 181,230 bales, down from 185,617 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 961 bales issued, 896 bales awaiting review, 5,348 cancellations, and 7,817 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
